  "ai_summary": "IT consultancy stocks are collapsing (down 26.4% in 30 days, 36.3% YoY), pricing in AI automation. Meanwhile, Indeed software dev postings show recent stability (up 3.6% monthly, 20.7% YoY). Big Tech headcounts reflect aggressive AI labor cuts\u2014Meta plunged 10.1% in 30 days (-9.5% YoY). Conversely, AI labs like Anthropic boast massive YoY hiring growth (+187.7%), though 30-day momentum has flatlined, pointing to a complex shifting developer market. Are devs cooked? Well, consulting firms are certainly being deep-fried by automation, but regular dev job postings are currently showing more bounce than a router dropped down a flight of stairs.",
